        <div class="table-header-row">
          <h2 class="section-title">The August Ladder — Ten Days, Twenty-One Legs</h2>
          <span class="pm-sec-date">Ideas as of Aug 27, 2026 · books walked 13:49 UTC · spot $78,989 · T = 4.59 days to Aug 31 23:59 ET</span>
