            <h3 class="panel-title"><span class="pm-badge pm-cheap">#1 · THE $80K LEG — RESOLVED, AND THE CARD&rsquo;S ARC WITH IT</span> <span class="pm-badge pm-fair">SETTLED YES · ROW 233</span> Binance printed <strong>$80,000 on Aug 24</strong> — the account sold its 418.01 sh at <strong>96.4–98.8¢ into the touch</strong>: +$82.95 realized on the 78.19¢ entry this card called a violation, −$8.17 against riding to par</h3>
