            <div class="pm-idea-date">Idea added Aug 21, 2026 <a class="pm-card-link" href="https://polymarket.com/event/what-price-will-bitcoin-hit-in-august-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Open this market on Polymarket">View on Polymarket ↗</a></div>
            <p>The basket this card spent a week flagging died the right way: sold, not decayed. The exit prices against tonight&rsquo;s mids — 32.5 / 15.95 / 6.05 / 3.55 — grade every sell <strong>GOOD by a combined +$679</strong>: each leg kept falling after the account left it, as the clock beat the spot rally on every strike above $82.5k. The realized ledger on the whole five-leg sweep, $80k included: <strong>−$591.39</strong> — the price of buying a momentum basket at the top of a +25% week and exiting it four sessions later. The card&rsquo;s standing line — &ldquo;the entry, not the market, is what is wrong with them&rdquo; — is now a settled fact with a dollar figure.</p>
            <div class="pm-exec"><strong>THE TICKET:</strong> <strong>File closed — no August exposure remains. The post-mortem number for the methodology box: the sweep&rsquo;s round trip cost $591 realized in five days, and holding to tonight would have cost $1,270. Selling the mistake beat riding it by 2:1.</strong></div>
