      <section class="table-section" aria-label="The December touch ladder and the skew">
        <div class="table-header-row">
          <h2 class="section-title">The December Ladder — The Skew</h2>
          <span class="pm-sec-date">Ideas as of Aug 27, 2026 · books walked 13:49 UTC · spot $78,989 · T = 126.6 days to Dec 31 23:59 ET</span>
          <span class="price-note" data-longform="2" data-longform-label="Read the full note">Twenty-nine live legs (the $80k reach resolved YES with August&rsquo;s), reach $85k–$1M and dip $60k–$5k · <strong>the up-rungs $85k–$120k imply σ 1.72–2.42%/day and the down-rungs $55k–$25k imply 2.59–4.48%</strong> — the touch week WIDENED the up-side gap: <strong>$90k −9.7 / $95k −10.0 / $100k −8.7, the page&rsquo;s three biggest capturable edges ($2,046 / $1,758 / $1,625)</strong> · the account&rsquo;s five Dec legs mark $2,763.98 (+$919.96) after the anchor&rsquo;s distribution-and-rebuy churn · the dip tail drifted further RICH ($45k +6.2, $40k +6.5)</span>
