        <div class="pm-cards">
          <div class="panel-card">
            <h3 class="panel-title"><span class="pm-badge pm-cheap">#1 · THE SKEW</span> <span class="pm-badge pm-rich">ONE CLAIM, NOT SIXTEEN EDGES</span> Every Dec up-rung from $85k to $120k implies σ 1.72–2.42%/day; the down-rungs from $55k to $25k imply 2.59–4.48% — the skew survived a week in which the up-side&rsquo;s case PRINTED ($80k touched and resolved)</h3>
